<h1><span lang="EN-US">Overview</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="whs4"><span lang="EN-US">The corrosion inspection functionality is accessible via the Modules menu.</span></p>
<p class="toolbar"><span lang="EN-US"><img src="Images/menu_corr.gif" width="113px" height="64px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="whs4"><span lang="EN-US">It performs 3 steps of processing:</span></p>
<ol>
<li class="kadov-p-CNumbered">
<p class="Numbered"><span lang="EN-US"><a href="Merging_Corrosion.htm">Merging</a> of raw data,</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CNumbered">
<p class="Numbered"><span lang="EN-US"><a href="Inspection_Corrosion.htm">Corrosion inspection</a>, and</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CNumbered">
<p class="Numbered"><span lang="EN-US"><a href="printing_Corrosion.htm">Report printing</a>.</span></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p><span lang="EN-US">The output of each tasks is the input to the next one (except for the third one). The steps can all be carried out at one go or each step can be performed individually (provided a suitable input file is specified).</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
